# Technical sources

Checked 2026-10-19. Treat as external capability evidence, not proof of precise library-version compatibility.

- **S-01** Three.js WebGPURenderer — migration, fallback, feature caveats: https://threejs.org/manual/pages/webgpurenderer
- **S-02** Three.js GLTFExporter — data types and extensions: https://threejs.org/docs/pages/GLTFExporter.html
- **S-03** Three.js MeshPhysicalMaterial — PBR and transmission: https://threejs.org/docs/pages/MeshPhysicalMaterial.html
- **S-04** Khronos glTF 2.0 — animations do not specify runtime behavior: https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF/blob/main/specification/2.0/Specification.adoc
- **S-05** Manifold 3D — manifold meshes and CSG: https://github.com/elalish/manifold
- **S-06** three-mesh-bvh — raycast and spatial queries: https://github.com/gkjohnson/three-mesh-bvh
- **S-07** Rapier — rigid body types, colliders and kinematic caveats: https://rapier.rs/docs/user_guides/javascript/rigid_bodies/
- **S-08** glTF Transform — simplify and meshopt: https://gltf-transform.dev/modules/functions/functions/simplify
- **S-09** glTF Transform — textureCompress browser limitations: https://gltf-transform.dev/modules/functions/functions/textureCompress
- **S-10** MDN — beforeunload restrictions: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/beforeunload_event
- **S-11** MDN — showSaveFilePicker limited compatibility: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/showSaveFilePicker
- **S-12** three-gpu-pathtracer — path tracing implementation: https://github.com/gkjohnson/three-gpu-pathtracer
- **S-13** Triad Studio source README (connected GitHub): https://github.com/4ertopolohh/triad-studio-project/blob/main/README.md
- **S-14** Triad Studio SCSS variables and palette: https://github.com/4ertopolohh/triad-studio-project/blob/main/frontend/src/styles/_variables.scss
- **S-15** Triad Studio font configuration: https://github.com/4ertopolohh/triad-studio-project/blob/main/frontend/src/styles/_fonts.scss
- **S-16** TRIAD-3D repository (empty on 2026-10-19): https://github.com/4ertopolohh/triad-3d
